Description: apex intrusion suite - Hollywood, remastered
 kraven draws a cinematic, multi-panel fake "hacking" dashboard in your
 terminal, in the spirit of the classic hollywood package but remastered:
 Matrix rain, a port sweep, exploit and brute-force sequences, a live
 hexdump exfiltration and the classic ACCESS GRANTED banner.
 .
 It is pure theatre: it performs no scanning, no exploitation and never
 touches the network. All addresses, services and output are randomly
 generated for visual effect only. Handy for demos, streams and pranks.
